# Receipts has no settings. The extension runs in the browser with no API key, no
# account and no server (docs/decisions/adr-001-local-only.md), and the build, test
# and eval scripts read only files in this repo.
#
# If a Node script ever needs a setting, its name goes here with a note on where the
# value comes from (never the value), the script reads .env from the repo root with
# util.parseEnv, and a variable already set in the real environment wins.
